{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Sqrt","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Complex.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.LinearCombination","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Positivity"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.A1_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.A1_eq","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/PhibSaddleA1Exact.lean#L92-L98","doc":"**The 2-loop coefficient is exactly `1/3 + (17√3/108)·i`.** From the division-free core\nby dividing through the nonzero `24·V₂³`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.V2_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.V2_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/PhibSaddleA1Exact.lean#L84-L90","doc":"`V₂ ≠ 0`. If `V₂ = 0` the core identity forces `V₃² = 0`, contradicting `V₃ ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.V3_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.V3_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/PhibSaddleA1Exact.lean#L75-L82","doc":"`V₃ ≠ 0` — its real part is `2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.a1_core_identity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.a1_core_identity","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/PhibSaddleA1Exact.lean#L62-L73","doc":"**Division-free core identity:** `3·V₄·V₂ − 5·V₃² = 24·V₂³·A₁`.\nThis is the content of `A₁ = V⁗/(8V''²) − 5V'''²/(24V''³)` cleared of denominators\n(`A₁ = (3·V₄·V₂ − 5·V₃²)/(24·V₂³)`). Proved by `linear_combination` against `(√3)² = 3`\nand `I² = −1`; the multiplier coefficients were computed by exact polynomial division. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.s_cpow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.s_cpow","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/PhibSaddleA1Exact.lean#L56-L60","doc":"`(√3 : ℂ)² = 3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.s_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.s_pos","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/PhibSaddleA1Exact.lean#L54-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.A1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.A1","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/PhibSaddleA1Exact.lean#L51-L52","doc":"The exact 2-loop coefficient. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.V4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.V4","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/PhibSaddleA1Exact.lean#L49-L49","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.V3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.V3","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/PhibSaddleA1Exact.lean#L48-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.V2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.V2","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/PhibSaddleA1Exact.lean#L45-L47","doc":"The three exact saddle derivatives of `V = Li₂(z) − Li₂(1/z)` at `z* = e^{iπ/3}`,\nas elements of `ℚ(√3, i) ⊂ ℂ` (numerically pinned, symbolically confirmed). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.s_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.s_sq","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/PhibSaddleA1Exact.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.s","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.PhibSaddleA1Exact.s","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/PhibSaddleA1Exact.lean#L40-L41","doc":"`√3` as a real number, with its defining square. ","signatureChunk":0}]}